# @name w2carton
POST {{baseUrl}}/item-unit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "name": "كرتونة"
}

### W2-2f Product: brush (فرشة), primary unit = piece
# @name w2brush
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "name": "فرشة",
  "categoryId": "{{w2category.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "primaryItemUnitId": "{{w2piece.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "retailPrice": 15,
