### WEEK 2 - MORE EXAMPLES (after the big test; same data)
### =====================================================================

### Currencies (default first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currency
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### A second currency: invoices in USD need an exchangeRate
POST {{baseUrl}}/currency
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "code": "USD",
  "name": "دولار أمريكي",
  "symbol": "$"
}

### All units of the brush (primary first) - for the unit dropdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{w2brush.response.body.$.data.id}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### Change a product unit (null clears barcode / retailPrice)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product-units/{{w2cartonUnit.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "barcode": "6221234567999",
  "retailPrice": 170
}

### All stock movements, newest first (filters: productId, warehouseId, type, dateFrom, dateTo; paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-movements?productId={{w2brush.response.body.$.data.id}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### Quotations list (filters: supplierId, branchId, status, dateFrom, dateTo, search; paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-quotations?status=CONVERTED
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### One quotation (lines + isExpired)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-quotations/{{w2quotation.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### Invoices list (filters: supplierId, branchId, warehouseId, status, paymentType, dateFrom, dateTo, search; paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-invoices?status=POSTED
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### One invoice (lines + purchaseReturns)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-invoices/{{w2invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### What can still be returned, per invoice line
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-invoices/{{w2invoiceId}}/returnable
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### Returning 11 cartons -> 400 QUANTITY_EXCEEDED
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-returns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "returnDate": "2026-11-25",
  "purchaseInvoiceId": "{{w2invoiceId}}",
  "lines": [
    {
      "purchaseInvoiceLineId": "{{w2post.response.body.$.data.lines[0].id}}",
      "quantity": 11
    }
  ]
}

### A return NOT linked to an invoice (send supplier, branch, warehouse, product, unit, price)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-returns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "returnDate": "2026-11-25",
  "supplierId": "{{w2supplier.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "branchId": "{{w2branch.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{w2warehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "reason": "زيادة",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{w2brush.response.body.$.data.id}}",
      "itemUnitId": "{{w2piece.response.body.$.data.id}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitCost": 11
    }
  ]
}

### Returns list (filters: supplierId, purchaseInvoiceId, status, dateFrom, dateTo; paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-returns?purchaseInvoiceId={{w2invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

### A direct purchase invoice (not from a quotation), CASH -> paidAmount = netTotal
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w2token}}

{
  "invoiceDate": "2026-11-25",
  "supplierInvoiceNumber": "NILE-901",
  "paymentType": "CASH",
  "supplierId": "{{w2supplier.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "branchId": "{{w2branch.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "warehouseId": "{{w2warehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{w2brush.response.body.$.data.id}}",
      "itemUnitId": "{{w2carton.response.body.$.data.id}}",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitCost": 148,
      "batchNumber": "B-2026-11"
    }
  ]
}
